{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"唐突ですが第２３３回目の日奈子ブログはじまっるよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！76回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nター坊さんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ター坊さんが数えてくださったみたいなんですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"122回連続更新中みたいです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は、時間ギリギリのブログ更新が続いたり、内容のないブログばかりで\n読んでくださっている方は\n少し減ってきてしまっている気がしますが\nいつまで続くかわかりませんが\nもうしばらくはブログ更新続けて行こうと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回、私のブログを読んでくださっている皆さん\n時々でも読んでくださっているみなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな今日も、夜遅くまでお仕事があり\nお家に着く頃にはきっと時間ギリギリだと思うので、空いてる時間で\nちょっとずつ書いてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/08/4864537/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"将棋フォーカスさんから頂いた\n桐谷さんのハンドタオル♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/08/4864537/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/08/4864537/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のお仕事が\nすごく楽しくて幸せだったの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きょうは時間がないから\nまた明日のブログでかきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！でも、詳しくはまだかけません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/08/4864537/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/08/4864537/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  福岡のせーやさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎最近、塩アイスでご飯食べに行ったりしたかな？\n日奈子、未央奈、純奈の塩アイスが、とても好きです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎行ってない！もうしばらく行ってない！\nいつから行ってないかわからないくらい\n行ってない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんさんの卒業ライブ後\n全国ツアーアンダーライブ前に\nオフが重なったらいきたいな♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうかな？純奈！未央奈！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(175)  どいやさん太郎さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎誰かの家にお泊まりってしたことないんだが、\nなんかわくわくすると同時にどきどきするというか、\n恥ずかしくなりそう笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎そうなんですか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと、ドキドキもワクワクもすると思います！\nお友達などと一緒にお布団にはいって\n話すはなしはきっといつもより"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"内容の濃い話になると思いますよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もメンバーとお泊まりすると\nいつもより深い話しをしたりします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(200)  ノーブルエースさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃん\nおはよさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんとひめたんの\n2ショット好き!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎こんばんわにさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな！うれしい！じゃあ、もう一枚載せちゃいます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへへへへ(´ー｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめちゃんすき！だいすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/08/4864537/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/08/4864537/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/08/4864537/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(308)  ずっくるさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎長野のお仕事お疲れ様！\nお泊まりいいね！楽しそう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎ありがとうございます！\n情報解禁されたら\nまたオフショット的な画像のせるね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お泊まりね！今日許可もらったよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝、ひめたんに会った瞬間ひめたんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「きいちゃんおうちくるんでしょ？うふふ♪」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"得意げな顔で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「もちろんいくよ♪」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってこたえた！たのしみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(450)  びーちゃんさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎少し前にもひめたん家泊まってたよね？\n最近急に仲良くなったのかな？\nみさ先輩やきもち焼いてない？\nみさ先輩、きいちゃん大好きだからな。\nあしゅもかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎行きました！！！\nひめたんとはジワジワ絆を深めてる気がする！\nでも、最近好き度は前よりも増してる♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ先輩とは、あまり会えてなくて\n会った時は近況報告！みたいなかんじで\n話したりします♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あすかちんとは、会ったら必ず\n適当なことをいって\n「なんだよっ！」と飛鳥ちんに言わせてます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう！みんなだいすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/08/4864537/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のヒナセレはこれにておわり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあしたねー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/08/4864537/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が考えてくださった\nブログ締めのあいさつ\n68回目は別れ際のんちゃんさんからです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっべぇぞっ！！\n急に暖かくなって、やっべぇぞっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ps.でもまた明日から\n寒いみたいなので\n皆さん、体調を崩されないように\n気をつけてくださいね(ノ_・。)、。。"}],"source":"archive"}